				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1148,
				2
			],
			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Introduce webview lifecycle state and message envelope types\n\nDefine the `WebviewLifecycleState::Enum` and `WebviewMessage::Struct` within the `Environment/WebviewProvider` module to establish the core data contracts for Tauri webview management.\n\nThe `WebviewLifecycleState::Enum` mirrors the VS Code webview state machine, explicitly defining the lifecycle transitions from `Unloaded` through `Loading`, `Loaded`, `Visible`, `Hidden`, to `Disposed`. The `WebviewMessage::Struct` serves as the serialization envelope for host-to-webview communication, encapsulating the `MessageIdentifier`, `MessageType` tag, `Payload`, and optional `Source` context.\n\nBoth types adhere to the project's strict PascalCase naming conventions and are configured with `Serialize` and `Deserialize` traits to support JSON transmission over the Tauri event bus, laying the groundwork for the `Wind` frontend service layer to manage native webview panel lifecycles.",
			"SHA": "c10618c8025d32eac34106831406614f1f7eb38a"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-02T09:05:33Z",
